// The app icon, compiled into BLiNX2.exe (blinx2 package) and, with the
// opt-in CAT_APP_ICON CMake option, into cat_recomp.exe: the taskbar shows
// the icon of the process that owns the window, which is the game, not the
// launcher. The .ico is the game's title image; it never enters git.
1 ICON "@ICON@"
